        2,
        3
      ],
      "rule": "governed by contract_json.schema_version: citrus-pose-observation-v1, v2 or v3; a file whose trial index has a step with features.fill.type heading_split (features.reactive present) must carry pose observation v2 or v3 complete (receipt complete): pose v1 or absent pose is refused for such a file with reactive_phototaxis_requires_pose_v2; a file under the video_overlay_v1 binding that carries pose must carry v3 (pose_v3_required_by_video_overlay_v1): every distinct sidecar verbatim at /observations/pose/sidecars/<sidecar_sha256> (bytes hash to sidecar_sha256, prefix64 equals ipc_skeleton_id_hash), and every object's heading_status and heading recomputed from its keypoints by contract_json.heading_arithmetic (pose_heading_arithmetic_v3): statuses, origin, forward, unit direction and eye check exactly, the angle within 1e-4 degrees by wrap_delta"
    },
