      "admitted_by_this_revision": true,
      "stimulus_angle_convention": "atan2_negative_y_x_degrees",
      "angle_semantics": "differs from frame_identity_v1 only in /components/moving_grating/states schema_version 2 -> 3 and /components/independent_motion_grid/states 1 -> 2, with the meanings of motion_direction_degrees_canvas and render_axis_degrees_canvas (moving_grating) and direction_degrees (independent_motion_grid) now counter-clockwise (+90 = up) and pointing at /metadata/session stimulus_angle_convention; no field name, type, offset or other table changes; the chaser table attributes angle_zero_direction and positive_rotation_direction are not written under angle_v1; legacy value = -value under wrap_delta (citrus-palette/angles/stimulus_angle_convention_v1.json)",
      "frame_identity": "agent-contracts citrus-orange/frame_identity_v1: one counter per table; removed triggering_camera_frame_id (frames, moving_grating), camera_frame_id (events), start_/end_camera_frame_id (trials), source_camera_frame_id (display_submissions), target_source_frame_id (chaser_state); renamed payload_frame_id and observation_frame_id to recording_frame_id (bounding_boxes, region_routing, region_candidates) and the nested slot provenance fields to state_/source_stream_frame_id",
      "bounding_boxes_row_rule": "one_row_per_source_frame_per_object_per_camera (as v2); recording_frame_id is Orange's recording counter from the SHAMAN v2 slot, 0 = received outside recording; consumers deduplicate in-recording rows on (recording_frame_id, payload_camera_id, box_index_in_payload) keeping the later payload_timestamp_ns_monotonic; rows with recording_frame_id 0 have no video frame"
    },
